  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {好|この}ましい⟦{結果|けっか}→結果：02486_kekka⟧ (favorable result)\n- {好|この}ましい⟦{印象|いんしょう}→印象：01846_inshou⟧ (favorable impression)\n- {好|この}ましく⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧ (not desirable)\nA formal, written-style adjective. Often used in business, official reports, or academic contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{好|す}き→好き：02355_suki⟧ (like - casual)\n- ⟦{好|この}む→好む：02103_konomu⟧ (to prefer - verb)\n- ⟦{望|のぞ}ましい→望ましい：12860_nozomashii⟧ (desirable - similar meaning)\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverb: {好|この}ましく\n- Noun form: {好|この}ましさ",
